{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process"
      ],
      "justification": "The opening unit implicitly triggers the process start node and describes the initial action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Course Packet Information Received should be sent"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct correspondence to the second step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty."
      ],
      "justification": "Preserves the sequential ordering and action described."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4_f"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact restatement of the faculty selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "Paraphrased but behaviour-preserving description of the clearance identification and outreach step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the XOR branch, its positive guard, and the associated notification action to the denial condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the alternative guard and cost calculation action to the fully cleared condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly captures the margin addition step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the second XOR branch, its loop-back guard, and the reconsideration action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the finalize-price guard and the subsequent bookstore notification action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the MPC notifies the Bookstore, the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore, and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the final notification step, structural convergence of the flow, and process termination."
    }
  ],
